  "description": "SAE J1939 application-layer node for CanKit.Pro: PGN send/receive with 29-bit Priority/PF/PS/SA encode/decode, SPN scale/offset extraction, PGN 0xEE00 Address Claiming with NAME arbitration (including Cannot-Claim), PGN 0xEA00 Request-PGN, and automatic multi-frame routing through CanKit.Pro.J1939Tp for payloads > 8 bytes. Composes on the CanKit.Pro L2 services (RawCan demux, TX-confirm, Actor, Reliability deadlines) with no vendor-SDK dependency.",
